<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῷον</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ-ώϊον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the upper part
				of the house,</i> where the women resided, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένος αἰδοίη ὑπερώϊον εἰσαναβᾶσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.514
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὑπερῷ᾽ ἀναβάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.184
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.362
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερωϊόθεν φρεσὶ σύνθετο θέσπιν
				ἀοιδὴν . . Πηνελόπεια</span>
			<i>from her chamber</i> she heard it, ib.<i><span class="en">
				328
			</span></i>; approached by a <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῖμαξ,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				330
			</span></i>: so in later Gr., <i>upper chamber</i> or <i>story,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.754
			</span></i> (Syria, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2146.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>attic, garret,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1001
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				811
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1638.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνωθ᾽ ἐξ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					698
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); of <i>a spare room,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.14
			</span></i>.</div>
